## 3. Historical vs. Live DB – Phone Overlap Analysis

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is the **core data gap** identified in previous analysis.

| Metric | Count | % of Historical |
|--------|-------|----------------|
| Unique phones in historical CSV | 310,857 | — |
| Unique phones in live DB | 193,779 | — |
| **Phones in BOTH** | **73,260** | **23.6%** ✅ |
| Only in historical Excel (not in DB) | **237,597** | **76.4%** ⚠️ |
| Only in live DB (not in Excel) | 120,519 | — |

> [!WARNING]
> **76.4% of historical customers (237,597 people) have never placed an order via the OE or POS APIs.** These customers exist only in the Excel dataset and cannot receive personalised recommendations until their data is ingested into the live DB (Deliverable 4).

---

## 4. Summary

| Dataset | Records | Phone Coverage | Email Coverage |
|---------|---------|---------------|---------------|
| Live DB (OE + POS) | 293,630 orders | 98.8% normalised | 45.6% |
| Historical Excel | 310,857 records | 100% normalised | 4.1% |

**Key Actions Outstanding:**
- **Deliverable 4:** Import the 237,597 exclusive historical records into the DB to close the 76.4% data gap.
- Enrich historical records with product/purchase history data from client (JobBox, Exhibition, Changan sources) to enable full personalisation.
